        the auditory-linguistic instance of receptive communication, so the target subsumes the source.
        Broader (high): direct verified SNOMED CT function-observable match on the same receptive axis,
        one-level broader because is the parent concept of the activity; mirrors the d115 -> 405019005
        precedent at. mapping_type=broader.
        """
}
